<http://www.dfki.de/lt/onto/intuitiv/domain.owl#IntuitivDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "<p style=\"margin-top: 0\">\n      the most general class which covers the concepts of the Intuitiv domain\n      without any particular epistemological backround; used to define a\n      &quot;naming&quot; property dom:name and a general &quot;free-text&quot; property dom:remark\n      from which potential useful information can be extracted through\n      external processes\n    </p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
