<http://www.dfki.de/lt/onto/intuitiv/domain.owl#isLocatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "<p style=\"margin-top: 0\">\n      dom:locatedAt is only defined on dom:Child, but not on other classes,\n      such as dom:Treatment or dom:Activity, as the child and a treatment or\n      activity in which it is involved in are &quot;connected&quot; through the time\n      stamp of the corresponding quadruple\n    </p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
